{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15219060","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15219060","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1521906001:0":{"text":"What's the matter?","source_cn":"有什么事？<key:dialog1>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x60D4FA54D4D0B218","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:2:1521906001":{"text":"What's the matter?","source_cn":"有什么事？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x60D4FA54D4D0B218","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1521906002:0":{"text":"Why should I tell you? Or this little Wildborn?","source_cn":"我为什么要告诉你？还有这个小兽人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x81082F586A29915A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1521906003:0":{"text":"Nanri just tried to end her life. We want to know why.","source_cn":"南茜刚才想跳崖寻死。我们只是想知道原因。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE3543827F5AA2CD3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1521906004:0":{"text":"What?! She tried to do that?!","source_cn":"什么？！还有这种事？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA9EAB575779C4737","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1521906005:0":{"text":"Sigh. More trouble...","source_cn":"唉，最近怎么都是这种麻烦事……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x81BBACEF3D6017C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1521906006:0":{"text":"Still, thank you for saving her.\nShe was devastated by the <style=\"highlight\">loss of her son</style>.","source_cn":"不管怎么样，谢谢你们救了她。\\n<style=high...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7EBF5D370DA70102","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1521906007:0":{"text":"I understand how she feels. <style=\"highlight\">Marc was the only family she had</style>.","source_cn":"我能理解她的心情，毕竟<style=highlight...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFCAF5BC68CFCF72E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1521906008:0":{"text":"What about her husband?","source_cn":"她的丈夫呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB4B52673345EEAE4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1521906009:0":{"text":"No clue. They're not from Halia. Just refugees from another town. Her husband's probably dead.","source_cn":"不知道。他们母子俩不是呼临人，是从其他城镇逃难过来的，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBC7F8A02629F44F2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1521906010:0":{"text":"She and her son had been living here in Halia alone. Then the flood hit. Their home was destroyed... and Marc was swept away.","source_cn":"在呼临城住下后，她和她儿子一直相依为命。但洪水冲垮了他...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x45DB5B0CE2F3B5DE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:14:1521906010":{"text":"She and her son had been living here in Halia alone. Then the flood hit. Their home was destroyed... and Marc was swept away.","source_cn":"在呼临城住下后，她和她儿子一直相依为命。但洪水冲垮了他们的房屋……把马可也一起卷走了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x45DB5B0CE2F3B5DE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1521906011:0":{"text":"It is. They never even found his body.","source_cn":"是的……连尸体都没有找到。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8D6D2A1D4BED3AB5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1521906012:0":{"text":"Since then, Nanri's been coming here every day, asking if there's any news about his son. It's like she believes he's still alive... It's wearing us all down.","source_cn":"从那之后，南茜就老是跑来问我们有没有马可的消息，就好像...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE2F550C2933A053F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1521906013:0":{"text":"First famine, then floods. It's already more than we can handle. We just don't have the time or resources to search for a child lost in the disaster.","source_cn":"先是饥荒，又是洪水，我们要处理的事太多了，实在没法帮她...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB53D0EA90642A59C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1521906014:0":{"text":"Sigh... I don't know when she'll finally accept the truth.","source_cn":"唉……不知道她什么时候才能接受现实。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x90F50FA82D419C7A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:14:0:1":{"text":"So Marc's...","source_cn":"看来马可已经……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x2772B0119F5BCB49","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"So Marc's...","female":"So Marc's...","variant_male_record_index":"78627","variant_female_record_index":"78628","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:14:1:2":{"text":"That's awful...","source_cn":"真是个悲惨的故事……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4879A2F1A8CBD6BC","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"That's awful...","female":"That's awful...","variant_male_record_index":"78629","variant_female_record_index":"78630","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:2:0:1":{"text":"(Ask about Nanri's past)","source_cn":"（询问南茜的过去）","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x91CDEB7AAFAD92A1","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"(Ask about